label "Graph of thoughts diagram"
box prob 16 106 70 40 "problem"
box t1 120 30 80 40 "thought A"
box t2 120 106 80 40 "thought B"
box t3 120 182 80 40 "thought C"
box agg 240 68 100 50 "aggregated|thought" acc
box score 240 160 100 44 "controller"
box ans 384 106 60 40 "answer"
arrow prob t1
arrow prob t2
arrow prob t3
arrow t1 agg
arrow t2 agg
arrow t3 score
arrow agg score
path "M 320 68 C 335 30 375 45 340 82" arrow
text 372 42 "refine" size=10
arrow score ans
note "combine and refine partial thoughts, not only branch them"
